in", "id": 6826232, "login": "konstin", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjY4MjYyMzI=", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/konstin/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/konstin/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/konstin/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/konstin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/konstin/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/konstin", "user_view_type": "public"}, "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/commits/eb5ec9539634e795e48264870fa8d580756c41b8/comments", "commit": {"author": {"date": "2025-09-17T11:18:41Z", "email": "konstin@mailbox.org", "name": "konsti"}, "comment_count": 0, "committer": {"date": "2025-09-17T11:18:41Z", "email": "noreply@github.com", "name": "GitHub"}, "message": "Better warning for no direct build (#15898)\n\n**Setup**\n\n```\n$ git clone https://github.com/wheelnext/variant_aarch64\n$ cd variant_aarch64\n$ git checkout 1d047e667dbce4c74878a68c653a6b41bc3d3684\n```\n\n**Before**\n\n```\n$ uv build -v\n[...]\nDEBUG Not using uv build backend direct build of , no pyproject.toml: TOML parse error at line 5, column 1\n  |\n5 | [project]\n  | ^^^^^^^^^\nmissing field `version`\n[...]\n```\n\n**After**\n\n```\n$ uv build -v\n[...]\nDEBUG Not using uv build backend direct build of ``, pyproject.toml does not match: The value for `build_system.build-backend` should be `\"uv_build\"`, not `\"flit_core.buildapi\"`\n[...]\n```\n\nThe empty string gets fixed in\nhttps://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/15897\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zanie Blue <contact@zanie.dev>", "tree": {"sha": "6d337947e99b2a63134fa3a94c7388eb080bd411", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/git/trees/6d337947e99b2a63134fa3a94c7388eb080bd411"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/git/commits/eb5ec9539634e795e48264870fa8d580756c41b8", "verification": {"payload": "tree 6d337947e99b2a63134fa3a94c7388eb080bd411\nparent d805d4a3707970e9f69247b188aaa72275898747\nauthor konsti <konstin@mailbox.org> 1758107921 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1758107921 +0200\n\nBetter warning for no direct build (#15898)\n\n**Setup**\n\n```\n$ git clone https://github.com/wheelnext/variant_aarch64\n$ cd variant_aarch64\n$ git checkout 1d047e667dbce4c74878a68c653a6b41bc3d3684\n```\n\n**Before**\n\n```\n$ uv build -v\n[...]\nDEBUG Not using uv build backend direct build of , no pyproject.toml: TOML parse error at line 5, column 1\n  |\n5 | [project]\n  | ^^^^^^^^^\nmissing field `version`\n[...]\n```\n\n**After**\n\n```\n$ uv build -v\n[...]\nDEBUG Not using uv build backend direct build of ``, pyproject.toml does not match: The value for `build_system.build-backend` should be `\"uv_build\"`, not `\"flit_core.buildapi\"`\n[...]\n```\n\nThe empty string gets fixed in\nhttps://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/15897\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zanie Blue <contact@zanie.dev>", "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoypkRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnjoQAGw4N92r0QqkKAn+MdzuTvy2\nu6IhQLgaTUVXs3J7+dYftDh8AEyXhC3YTp2AQS7X4fm5Nl6UBfHxL4jjlGzFMAJG\nvt31HWAv234TwxN38uom+sERI+/IyOphUYHzGHExlBbkv2zuNkEYppbjdw19zVvf\nF4CqnYLWjxwFIxuQ/Pk4ZkQd3j6zTskKA33xU/F4t5PGolOdchqPOplUBSTEOzRP\n8rzT2ftcEy5ZSnUj/yAZoAHcC0KSoda/JKnIG29uzRKFb/YSAdZucZD2EAt1HvFP\nX25sXtLgjwkhVkGBfpFO+7V+h3P+D5p9tCyI2u2PwEipdpboQZM31GNMsyRZd3Uh\noYMhPF7kqmM3J82rQoMwpxIKva4PvjH5eEP4plHvZ2lJAZ2uBdAyB8HB0Xv3RAp2\n4FijTuZfb2nYaBMpQY09UgLoRXeU3ueaOFVD0078ju3ahll4duuIxn+eNInDhJ6j\nA3+vX5Md4Yeexgt2St0PBQGZRHlmCtSfCKn/4dtffgWRDtfu/UndB13Kjcz5KXTz\nqMIr11RfHwOnU0Cctc7+TnzonLcWXfMT3aSqPb1TDdWg7UpiuhpF9a8FRUMXFL+s\n/Gt2eATJxHPlcs7vQVW2ix27adeD7ABlrcuLvfUq4dkSxm3ar5hkCvKte0BdydM6\naSCDq8Yp7sVPSZAHdc2p\n=gqcR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "verified": true, "verified_at": "2025-09-17T11:18:41Z"}}, "committer": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/